# Every checkout gets LF text files, whatever the client's core.autocrlf, so a
# default Git for Windows clone passes Prettier and copies LF starter templates.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.tar binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
